title: $:/plugins/rimir/ports/changelog
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

! Changelog

|!Version |!Date |!Changes |
|v0.1.5 |2026-11-03 |Several targets in one drag (multi-value ports): tap Shift over a target to pick or unpick it, hold Shift to sweep-pick every target the pointer moves onto; Shift + letter still types a capital and undoes that hold's picks. Picks get pinned wires (team members dashed) and are counted in the dock; release links all picks plus the target under the pointer, also over empty space, in one write with one notification. New library `connect.js` (drop plan + message, with specs) replaces the separate single/group connect code. Dock tiles scrolled out of the dock list no longer get wires. |
|v0.1.4 |2026-11-03 |Drag from kind's field bar: the icon of a ref field (tiddler view and stream rows) starts a drag like the field's flyout row and adds the dropped tiddler to that field; a plain click still opens kind's field popup, the click after a drag is eaten. Needs kind 0.1.97 (field icons carry `data-kind-*`). |
|v0.1.3 |2026-11-03 |Groups: on a multi port that takes a group's member kind but not the group (kind `kind.group-of`, needs kind ≥ 0.1.91), the group is a valid target and listed in the dock with its member count; dropping it appends the members not linked yet. |
|v0.1.2 |2026-11-03 |Clicking a dock tile opens that instance in the story (tile is a non-draggable `$link`); dropping a port on a tile still only links it. |
|v0.1.1 |2026-10-29 |Dock candidates sorted by caption (deterministic order). |
|v0.1.0 |2026-10-29 |First version: hover handle on kind instances in the story, port flyout (labelled ref fields, empty ports collapsed, click to list targets, × to unlink), drag-to-connect with a live wire, context dock that opens on drag (ref candidates, option sources, recent first, type to filter, Esc cancels), hover wires to visible targets. |
